./batch08/58-df-effective-rational-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d,\\alpha \\in V\">\\(X,d,\\alpha \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle m,n,k\\rangle_\\omega\">\\(\\langle m,n,k\\rangle_\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rat}:\\omega\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\operatorname{rat}:\\omega\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 均由新增内部有效有理数编号文件中的等式定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\alpha:\\omega\\to X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(d(x,\\alpha(n))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(q)\\land\\forall m,n,k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\left|\\operatorname{rat}(q(\\langle m,n,k\\rangle_\\omega))-d(\\alpha(m),\\alpha(n))\\right|\\leq2^{-k}\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\alpha:\\omega\\to X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(d(x,\\alpha(n))&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(q)\\land\\forall m,n,k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\left|\\operatorname{rat}(q(\\langle m,n,k\\rangle_\\omega))-d(\\alpha(m),\\alpha(n))\\right|\\leq2^{-k}\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 给出稠密编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 对所有编号点对及精度参数统一计算距离的有理近似。</li>\n<li>“每个距离各自是可计算实数”不蕴含所需的统一可计算性；这里显式加入统一逼近器。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-rational-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"b8eaf43a040e88b2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-effective-rational-coding.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d,\\alpha \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle m,n,k\\rangle_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rat}:\\omega\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\alpha:\\omega\\to X\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(d(x,\\alpha(n))<\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(q)\\land\\forall m,n,k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\left|\\operatorname{rat}(q(\\langle m,n,k\\rangle_\\omega))-d(\\alpha(m),\\alpha(n))\\right|\\leq2^{-k}\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false}],"bytes":1805,"backlinks":[{"id":"99f12f1125ed236a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"edf92e1f691cd322","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"69b5b67f3d7445d9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,d,\\alpha$ (computable dense metric presentation, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]])"},{"id":"aae13e7d5032f432","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space.md|58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ce876585d129ce97","37437e63af9f668e","b8eaf43a040e88b2"]}